// A budget stop inside a nested rewrite (buildEq's ite push counts on a
// scratch set of counters) shows the totals: seam.rule-calls is not 0 and is
// the rule-calls of the `budget: hit` line.
// Limits 150..254 stop at many points of the encoding, some of them inside
// such a rewrite.
// RUN: sh %S/Inputs/stats-totals.sh %sea_vc %S/node-budget.mlir 150 2 254 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: totals

